{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"ja","entryId":"swarm-disaster","chapterId":"event-rogue-4","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-4-talk-403810227-line","text":"図書館の真ん中にある古い階段は、螺旋状に天まで続いていて、終わりが見えない。","speaker":"模擬宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-4-talk-403810228-line","text":"「また来たのか？」虚構歴史学者は怒鳴る、「今度はどんな歴史を変えて欲しいんだ？」","speaker":"模擬宇宙"},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-4-text-11933698245015459661-choice","text":"「記憶」に関する記録を書き換える","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-4-text-8573602592670311128-choice","text":"「愉悦」に他の記録を上書きさせる！","speaker":""},{"id":"swarm-disaster-event-rogue-4-text-11009046996928279928-effect","text":"ランダムな祝福3個を強化済みのランダムな祝福に変える","speaker":""}]}
